cff-version: 1.2.0
title: vessel-fuel-model
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Umuhoza
    given-names: Jean d'Amour
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0008-7067-8817
repository-code: https://github.com/JdUmuhoza/vessel-fuel-model
abstract: >-
  Physics-based and grey-box vessel fuel-consumption models (calibrated white-box,
  black-box, serial and constrained grey-box), with propagation of predicted fuel to
  CO2, CH4, N2O and CO2e. Includes the code that reproduces the tables of the
  accompanying paper on the Shifts and FuelCast benchmarks.
keywords:
  - maritime
  - vessel
  - fuel-consumption
  - grey-box model
  - distribution shift
  - greenhouse-gas emissions
license: MIT
version: 0.3.0
identifiers:
